        "created_at": "2011-09-16T04:21:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Smoke Bombs: It activates any time the hero with the lowest HP takes damage from a villain card, regardless of what the triggering card actually reads.<br>\nBanshee and Summer: In both cases, it’s considered a tie between all heroes, so you pick the hero(es) to receive the damage.</p>",
